Z||000007||Fformula88||10-17-2001||05:11 PM||||Very nice looking motor!  I am a little surprised its only gotten you down into the 7's.  My  88 Formula's stock 2.8 auto will hit 60 in about 8.7 and I would think the added displacement and build of your 3.4 would get you there a bit quicker.<P>Maybe its just the limitations of the stock torque converter?  Automatics transmissions can be built to be faster too, maybe the Fiero's auto needs some attention.  Opinions wanted!!||||reg||1
